 # SF Guardrail is a safety mediator, not a policy engine
 
+> Updated 2026-09-22 by
+> [ADR 0118](./0118-sf-guardrail-supports-an-optional-local-jev-risk-provider.md):
+> a qualified local Jev provider may judge semantic risk for eligible requests.
